OL,3,GNEWSAPark and ride site to close ahead
OL,4,Aof Goose Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA park and ride site in Nottingham is
OL,7,Fset to close ahead of the city's
OL,8,Fhistoric Goose Fair.
OL,10,FThe fair, which last year featured
OL,11,Fabout 400 rides and stalls and
OL,12,Fattracted half a million visitors, is
OL,13,Fdue to take place on the Forest
OL,14,FRecreation Ground between 25 September
OL,15,Fand 4 October.
OL,17,FIn preparation for the event, The
OL,18,FForest park and ride site will be
OL,19,Fclosed from 18:00 BST on 20 September.
OL,21,FTram services will still be running
OL,22,Fduring the closure, the council said.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
